   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Dark and moody warm: crushed blacks (p1 ~0), low midtones (~82), warm yellow highlights (~218/211/193), saturation 0.29, skin warm-honey. Best for: Evening / night receptions, candle-lit or fairy-light frames, dramatic couple portraits, low-key varmala and pheras. On bright daylight frames use variation 02 to avoid overly dark results.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
